{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c9b5","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d4c8-c91a-7382-bd41-b29e82ff449b"},"sequence":821,"recorded_at":1780531400001637,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"297f9a28-ff2a-4f3d-8e2c-f78b2b2814d6","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"297f9a28-ff2a-4f3d-8e2c-f78b2b2814d6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"297f9a28-ff2a-4f3d-8e2c-f78b2b2814d6"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d4ce-5d8d-7923-a3dd-945aed8a5d8f"},"task_id":"01a0d4ce-5d8d-7923-a3dd-945aed8a5d8f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d4ce-5d8d-7923-a3dd-945aed8a5d8f","chunk":"Read text file `internal/clonereadback/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n1|# TRACEABILITY — internal/clonereadback\n2|\n3|Fourth leaf of STORY-260830-21bxa3 (M4): Clone Read-Back Evidence\n4|Manifest 1.0.0 and Clone Validation Report 1.0.0 as closed schemas\n5|with JCS identities, pinned to SPEC v0.7.0 §13.14.2. The read-back\n6|mode derives from the trusted read authority threaded from the\n7|caller chain, and the report binds its references to the two\n8|trusted sibling reads. Tuple cross-match, plan/projected/fidelity\n9|pairing, and the Story registry belong to the final leaf\n10|(TASK-260830-1esv6u).\n11|\n12|Authority quotes below come from\n13|`internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md` (pinned v0.7.0). Line numbers are\n14|1-based.\n15|\n16|## Axis inventory (written first)\n17|\n18|Every gate axis the conformance matrix walks, with its domain:\n19|\n20|| Axis | Domain | Oracle |\n21||---|---|---|\n22|| A1 shape members | every member of readback (16), evidence (5), report (23): reflection over the input types plus the sealed-minus-input envelope derivation | missing/extra/duplicated/miscased/wrong-type refused with the member literal at every entry, envelope included |\n23|| A2 schema/version | the two literal pairs from the registry (lines 170-171) | sibling URNs, 2.0.0/1.0 versions